Dialogue: 10,0:01:05.72,0:01:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Too much of anything will always bring disorder:
Dialogue: 10,0:01:11.28,0:01:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Disproportionate power,
Dialogue: 10,0:01:13.23,0:01:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,overwhelming emotion,
Dialogue: 10,0:01:14.93,0:01:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,excessive desire.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:16.65,0:01:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And without fail,
Dialogue: 10,0:01:17.84,0:01:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,for every strong attraction, \Nthere will be a force to restore the balance.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:22.90,0:01:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Like a pendulum, they go back and forth.
