Dialogue: 10,0:04:03.17,0:04:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Miku! Miku! Miku! Miku!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:48.54,0:04:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This is so much fun, Yoshino, Yoshinon!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:50.86,0:04:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:52.28,0:04:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go one more time, Tohka-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:54.59,0:04:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:57.94,0:04:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmph!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:58.81,0:05:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Losing their composure over a slide...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:00.92,0:05:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Tohka and Yoshino are still so immature.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:03.96,0:05:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Remark: You have "jealous" written all over your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.53,0:05:11.16,Sign #10a,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75\fs67.5\shad1.5\c&HD5B7FC&\4c&HBA9EE0&\pos(544,82.001)\alpha&H00&\t(0,454,\alpha&HFF&)\t(454,908,\alpha&H00&)\t(908,1361,\alpha&HFF&)\t(1361,1815,\alpha&H00&)\t(1815,2269,\alpha&HFF&)\t(2269,2723,\alpha&H00&)\t(2723,3176,\alpha&HFF&)\t(3176,3630,\alpha&H00&)}W
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.53,0:05:11.16,Sign #10,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75\fs67.5\shad1.5\c&HD5B7FC&\4c&HBA9EE0&\pos(698.001,58.001)\alpha&H00&\t(0,454,\alpha&HFF&)\t(454,908,\alpha&H00&)\t(908,1361,\alpha&HFF&)\t(1361,1815,\alpha&H00&)\t(1815,2269,\alpha&HFF&)\t(2269,2723,\alpha&H00&)\t(2723,3176,\alpha&HFF&)\t(3176,3630,\alpha&H00&)}Jealous
Dialogue: 10,0:05:08.32,0:05:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I do not!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:09.61,0:05:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm only a {\i1}teensy{\i0} bit jealous!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:12.69,0:05:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Suggestion: Want to try the slide with me?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:17.08,0:05:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:18.29,0:05:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Miku. Is this really okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:20.84,0:05:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, we've got the whole pool all to ourselves.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:23.47,0:05:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:24.63,0:05:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I asked my staff to find us an after-party venue,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:28.40,0:05:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,and they got me this.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:30.30,0:05:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a superstar for you.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:32.78,0:05:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:34.06,0:05:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you going to swim?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:36.10,0:05:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The water's lovely and warm!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:39.60,0:05:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just hang out here.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:41.37,0:05:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Then {\i1}you{\i0} best get over here, Kotori-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:43.98,0:05:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Or could it be our commander {\i1}can't{\i0} swim?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:47.07,0:05:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:48.32,0:05:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You {\i1}saw{\i0} me swimming at Ocean Park!{probably reference to the fanservice episode, check that}{it's a reference to Kotori and Shido's date. it's correct.}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:54.74,0:05:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}You'll pay for that, Kotori!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:55.68,0:05:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for inviting us, Miku.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:57.75,0:05:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I really enjoyed your concert.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:59.85,0:06:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:01.08,0:06:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The audience seemed to like it,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:03.37,0:06:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,and if you did too, I can ask for nothing more.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:06.96,0:06:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you still wearing your t-shirt?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:09.09,0:06:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Fact: Master Origami has taught me
Dialogue: 10,0:06:12.36,0:06:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,that a swimsuit is not a swimsuit\N unless it is seen through a wet t-shirt.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:18.19,0:06:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I'm gonna go get my t-shirt!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:24.65,0:06:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The fact that every one of you \Nis here because you truly want to be{I'm so happy I have people who actually want to spend time with me.}{That everyone came without me "asking" is happiness.}{I assume she's saying it's great she didn't have to use her powers on them to get them to come.}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:28.61,0:06:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,makes me so happy.{TL: I like this.}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:30.96,0:06:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I'm going to swim for a bit, too!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:43.33,0:06:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You're staring, Darling.{He has 'ecchi' eyes? Sounds uncomfortable.}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:54.14,0:06:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You really don't need a ride home?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:57.14,0:06:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, there are too many of us.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:59.82,0:07:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about us.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:01.14,0:07:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,If it comes to it, we could always hitch a ride on Fraxinus.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:04.72,0:07:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Cake...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:06.00,0:07:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's cake.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:07.62,0:07:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, that's cake.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:10.15,0:07:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can promise to be quiet \Non the train home, I'll buy you one.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:14.32,0:07:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:15.60,0:07:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I promise.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:19.01,0:07:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. Darling, friends, we shall meet again!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:22.56,0:07:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:23.44,0:07:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep up the good work, Miku.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:25.38,0:07:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I will!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:36.74,0:07:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:38.22,0:07:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:39.56,0:07:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,This is kinda nice, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:43.17,0:07:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:02.97,0:08:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:04.32,0:08:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:05.82,0:08:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,it's nothing.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:46.76,0:08:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Onii-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:48.08,0:08:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Wakey, wakey!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:50.06,0:08:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're already up.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:51.96,0:08:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Kotori!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:52.67,0:08:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,L-Look at this!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:54.45,0:08:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?{TL: Although the response is appropriate purely in English context, keep in mind that this "Are~~??" is not the general utterance for confusion but quoting the subject of Shido's "Are miro!" (literally "Look at that!")}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:57.14,0:08:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,At what?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:58.30,0:08:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean you can't...{"At what?"?}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:09.34,0:09:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Shido,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:11.31,0:09:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,you say you can see a giant \Nsphere somewhere over there?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:14.83,0:09:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:16.84,0:09:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You can see something no one else can!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:18.92,0:09:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That's amazing, Nii-sama!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:22.94,0:09:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I still need more training!{Dragonball reference I think??}{Nah, the visuals are way off for that, but it's definitely a reference to something.}{Looks like polyphonica to me}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:25.70,0:09:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I really don't think you do.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:28.56,0:09:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be invisible because\N it's cloaked, like our ship?{TL: can wording be a little less roundabout? "Invisible" isn't a critical word, so long as it's consistent with the TV series}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:32.89,0:09:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,If it were, there's no reason Shido \Nwould be the only one who can see it.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:36.85,0:09:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I doubt it's DEM, either.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:40.05,0:09:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Analysis complete!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:41.76,0:09:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We do indeed see faint Spirit waves\N radiating spherically from that location.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:46.94,0:09:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So there {\i1}is{\i0} something there.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:48.48,0:09:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We've detected the waves,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:51.27,0:09:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,but that doesn't tell us much about the object.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:53.80,0:09:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we can be certain that there is \Nsome sort of energy build-up there.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:57.82,0:10:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it a new Spirit?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:00.01,0:10:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No, hold on.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:02.03,0:10:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,As a whole, the signal seems complex,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:04.33,0:10:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,but break it down and you find...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:06.79,0:10:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Tohka, Yoshino,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:08.16,0:10:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,the Yamai sisters, Miku, and also Kotori.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:11.25,0:10:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,There are signals resembling those of\N every Spirit that Shin has sealed so far.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:16.20,0:10:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:17.76,0:10:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,They're a 99.6% match.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:20.43,0:10:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,She's absolutely right.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:22.77,0:10:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Kotori, that sphere might be \NSpiritual energy from you Spirits.{We used Spiritual energy in DAL2, but I prefer it this way}{He had Spirit energy, but I like consistency more, leaving it up to you Naine}{I'd prefer consistency. The S2 subs should be seen as absolute truth now.}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:27.82,0:10:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Our energy?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:28.89,0:10:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, so you were just messing with us!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:32.48,0:10:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Such a mischievous girl, aren't'cha?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:38.19,0:10:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for the delicate abuse!{TL: "Delicate" might be a better word}{yeah}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:40.32,0:10:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,This is just my hypothesis,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:42.51,0:10:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,but the sphere could be a manifestation \Nof the Spirits' subconsciouses.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:47.45,0:10:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:48.89,0:10:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, some of your\N emotions took shape as this sphere.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:55.49,0:10:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Emotions like...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:56.36,0:10:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Jealousy.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:57.48,0:10:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What's that supposed to mean, Shiizaki?!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:59.82,0:11:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:01.47,0:11:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}But I feel that you and the other Spirits each have some desire,\N big or small, to have Shido-kun to yourselves.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:08.80,0:11:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:10.60,0:11:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to stay with him in every moment,
Dialogue: 10,0:11:12.73,0:11:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,but you can't, no matter how hard you try!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:15.63,0:11:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Minowa!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:16.52,0:11:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your bad habits out of this!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:18.27,0:11:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Stress {\i1}is{\i0} an inherently subconscious thing, though.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:23.44,0:11:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,One day, my wife ran off along with\N everything in the house, with absolutely no—
Dialogue: 10,0:11:29.75,0:11:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Kawagoe!
