Dialogue: 10,0:11:33.37,0:11:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I suspect that each of your relationships with Shido-kun has problems of its own.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:38.38,0:11:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, you're {\i1}all{\i0} in love with him, after all.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:42.22,0:11:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,They all raise good points.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:44.89,0:11:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,While we continue our investigation of the sphere,
Dialogue: 10,0:11:48.07,0:11:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,let's find ways to relieve the Spirits' stress.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:51.52,0:11:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,L-Like how?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:53.52,0:11:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that obvious?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:55.05,0:11:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,By dating them.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:55.96,0:11:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:56.77,0:12:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,One by one, take them\N wherever they want on a date.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:01.52,0:12:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,During your date with each Spirit,\N you will be theirs and only theirs.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:05.91,0:12:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no telling what that'll do to the invisible sphere.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:10.82,0:12:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, I think it's better than doing nothing.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:14.12,0:12:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you say, Kotori?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:16.68,0:12:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I-It's not like we have any better ideas.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:22.37,0:12:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck, Shin.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:24.67,0:12:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Okay...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:32.02,0:12:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,System Cherub...{new Spirit is called Kerubiel or something so probably it. Could be "Cherub"}{Her angel is "Kerubiel", referencing an actual angel whose name is also transcribed as "Cherubiel", and related to Cherubim/Cherub (never seen as "Kerub" or at least not in English) which is named after it. It's arguable which is more common, but given the fact, I think we should use Cherubiel.}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:36.29,0:12:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:37.44,0:12:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I can go on a date with you?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:39.69,0:12:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:40.69,0:12:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we go right now?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:42.65,0:12:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold your horses, Tohka.{TL: Could be more colloquial if need be. Like "Hold your horses, Tohka" or something.}{sounds good to me}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:44.78,0:12:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll draw straws to pick the order.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:46.91,0:12:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do what you want.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:48.60,0:12:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Make it the best date of your life.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:51.95,0:12:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,A date with Darling!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:55.40,0:12:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm starting to get excited!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:57.92,0:13:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Question: Will Yuzuru and Kaguya go together?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:01.69,0:13:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way would work fine,{"I don't mind" implies they're doing it for reina's sake or something}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:03.66,0:13:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,but I suppose one-on-one\N would be good for a change.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:06.55,0:13:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And I did prepare {\i1}six{\i0} straws.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:10.76,0:13:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready, set...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:13.60,0:13:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm second!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:15.06,0:13:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm number three.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:17.07,0:13:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Result: Fourth.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:18.73,0:13:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like I'm fifth.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:20.45,0:13:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Six...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:21.60,0:13:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm last.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:23.20,0:13:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, well!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:24.57,0:13:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That's settled, then.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:25.90,0:13:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, plan out your dates,\N and then wait for your turn.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:30.72,0:13:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, with me going first, \Nit seems you're all out of luck.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:35.33,0:13:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Once Shido experiences the\N ultimate, paramount, perfect date,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:39.68,0:13:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\t(2860,3570,\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}{no matter what else he tries, he'll never be satisfied!}he will be content with no one but I!{TL: Probably could be more direct, like "I will be the only one that can satisfy him!" or something, maybe minus the innuendo if that's possible lel}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:43.92,0:13:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebuttal: You will fail.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:47.26,0:13:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You will fail so magnificently \Nthat you'll be a superb example {\i1}not{\i0} to follow.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:52.51,0:13:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I {\i1}will not{\i0} fail!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:53.97,0:13:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to ace it!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:54.81,0:13:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I doubt it.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:55.26,0:13:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Yoshino, you're going on a date with Shido-kun!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:58.14,0:13:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you do it?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:59.52,0:14:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:00.88,0:14:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I'll be okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:03.09,0:14:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I think.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:03.90,0:14:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just make this clear:
Dialogue: 10,0:14:06.06,0:14:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not interfere with each other's dates,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:08.81,0:14:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,and keep your actions reasonable.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:11.10,0:14:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:12.24,0:14:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:13.71,0:14:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, for some closing remarks by Shido.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:15.50,0:14:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Right...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:16.89,0:14:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I'm looking forward to going out with all of you.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:19.79,0:14:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show you the time of your life!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:22.52,0:14:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Agreement: I'll make it a wonderful day.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:25.84,0:14:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You can count on me to make it a blast!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:28.01,0:14:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so excited, Darling!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:30.22,0:14:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll... um...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:32.24,0:14:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do my best.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:33.43,0:14:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Her best!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:34.83,0:14:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:44.44,0:14:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That's that girl from...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:11.34,0:15:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't been on a date\N without an earpiece for a while.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:14.51,0:15:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a little nervous, but I guess it {\i1}does{\i0}\N take off some of the pressure.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:19.28,0:15:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,But man...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:20.67,0:15:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,although I've gotten used to seeing it,\N that thing still creeps me out.{TL: "I've gotten used to it, but that thing still creeps me out."}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:24.42,0:15:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:26.77,0:15:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry. Did I make you wait?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:28.96,0:15:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right on time.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:30.77,0:15:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I just came here too early.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:33.15,0:15:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I actually meant to come a little earlier,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:36.37,0:15:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,but since we're on a date,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:38.45,0:15:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I spent a little longer getting dressed for the occasion.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:41.48,0:15:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think? Do I look strange?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:43.37,0:15:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you look great.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:45.34,0:15:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:46.48,0:15:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:49.12,0:15:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I guess...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:51.08,0:15:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuzuru would usually make some jab at me here...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:55.26,0:15:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,but she's not here today.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:57.34,0:15:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,This is gonna be awkward.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:59.23,0:16:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That's fine by me.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:00.72,0:16:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's us two who are on this date.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:03.25,0:16:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever awkward moments there are, \Nthey're part of our chemistry.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:07.79,0:16:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,R-Right!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:10.60,0:16:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:11.78,0:16:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to show me the \N"ultimate, paramount, perfect date," right?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:16.45,0:16:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:17.41,0:16:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,L-Leave it to me!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:20.93,0:16:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,So Kaguya chose to meet him here.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:23.71,0:16:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:25.37,0:16:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Should we really be following them like this?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:28.05,0:16:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't see why not!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:29.49,0:16:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,The rules only said we couldn't {\i1}interfere{\i0}.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:32.51,0:16:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Awestruck: Kaguya, you're amazing.{Wow, for some reason I thought that said awesometruck at first}{same thing}
Dialogue: 10,0:16:35.93,0:16:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't call you Kagu-yuck anymore.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:39.43,0:16:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,So Shido,
Dialogue: 10,0:16:41.00,0:16:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,did you come on an \Nempty stomach like I told you?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:43.71,0:16:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, all I've had this morning is a glass of milk.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:48.72,0:16:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What are we going to have?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:51.71,0:16:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Get this.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:53.44,0:16:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Tucked away down this alley, \Nthere's an amazing restaurant!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:56.95,0:16:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, I've never heard of it.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:58.81,0:16:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:59.74,0:17:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a really fancy French restaurant.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:02.20,0:17:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's called...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:03.76,0:17:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:07.04,0:17:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It was called, um...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:08.78,0:17:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:09.98,0:17:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter, does it? \NLet's get going.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:12.54,0:17:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah, let's.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.47,0:17:16.97,Sign #7,,0,0,0,,{\b1\c&HC6B6AC&\blur1.05\pos(828,361.2)}Ramen
Dialogue: 10,0:17:20.67,0:17:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this it?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:22.48,0:17:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, it's...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:24.12,0:17:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:28.75,0:17:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kaguya.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:30.03,0:17:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't we just eat here?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:31.90,0:17:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm about to starve to death.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:34.27,0:17:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We can try the French place\N some other time, all right?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:38.37,0:17:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, if you don't mind...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:40.96,0:17:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's get in there!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:44.29,0:17:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:45.75,0:17:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Come again!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:48.25,0:17:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh man, that was great!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:50.96,0:17:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That was the best ramen I've ever had!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:53.58,0:17:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you know about this place, Shido?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:55.82,0:18:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,No, and if you hadn't brought me here, I still wouldn't.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:01.53,0:18:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:02.97,0:18:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess that's okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:04.77,0:18:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry. I promised you French cuisine,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:07.32,0:18:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,and yeah, the ramen {\i1}was{\i0} good, but...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:10.06,0:18:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:12.18,0:18:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This next place, though—\NI'm 100% sure about the next place!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:14.98,0:18:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a gnarly pool bar that all \Nthe dudes and dudettes{cool kids} go to!{she's using old slang}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:18.14,0:18:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What?{same shido}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:19.95,0:18:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-This can't be right.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:22.08,0:18:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not a groovy, gnarly, bee's-knees\N pool bar anymore?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:26.78,0:18:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not old enough to be going to bars.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:29.75,0:18:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just play {somewhere around}in here!{pretty sure he's referring specifically to the arcade before them}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:32.44,0:18:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I won!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:33.92,0:18:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:35.68,0:18:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is everything going wrong?{Why did it turn out this way?}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:38.71,0:18:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,We ate ramen, and now we're at an arcade.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:41.31,0:18:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with that?{TL: Question mark here?}{yes}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:42.64,0:18:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm having fun.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:44.14,0:18:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:45.56,0:18:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, actually, I can't say I'm not either.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:56.91,0:18:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up, Shido?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:58.56,0:19:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh... it's nothing.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:03.63,0:19:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for organizing this, Kaguya.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:05.61,0:19:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No, thank {\i1}you{\i0}.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:11.32,0:19:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Shido...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:13.49,0:19:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:15.11,0:19:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:16.16,0:19:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just following this guide the whole time.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:19.70,0:19:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't {\i1}my{\i0} plan at all.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:22.22,0:19:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I tried making{thinking of} one myself, \Nbut I didn't feel like it'd work out.{didn't have confidence.}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:27.84,0:19:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I see.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:29.17,0:19:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess your book was a little outdated.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:32.35,0:19:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess so.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:33.82,0:19:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:34.60,0:19:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:35.96,0:19:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We both had fun.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:38.27,0:19:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That makes the date a success.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:42.53,0:19:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Does it?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:44.90,0:19:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It does.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:46.79,0:19:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:51.28,0:19:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,See you later, Shido!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:53.25,0:19:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:59.42,0:20:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaguya-chan's date has been completed!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:01.76,0:20:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Analyzing Spirit wave source.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:05.34,0:20:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We're seeing changes!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:06.88,0:20:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The element resembling Kaguya-chan's \Nsignal has become weaker!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:10.52,0:20:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like we're on the right track.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:12.62,0:20:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:13.69,0:20:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we'll continue for each Spirit\N and see what happens.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:30.91,0:20:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,She's been like that ever since she came home.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:34.04,0:20:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Envy: The plan was a wreck, but they\N certainly seemed to enjoy themselves.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:40.25,0:20:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I need to step up my game!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:43.00,0:20:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to revise my plan!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:46.29,0:20:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Tohka-chan's really giving it her all!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:49.16,0:20:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,So what's your plan, Yuzuru-chan?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:51.55,0:20:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Secret: I will just use some things as inspiration.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:59.96,0:21:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, Darling.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:02.07,0:21:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to meet with you somewhere \Nfor a regular date,
Dialogue: 10,0:21:06.08,0:21:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,but because "people would go crazy if\N they saw Izayoi Miku walking with a man,"
Dialogue: 10,0:21:10.09,0:21:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Kotori-san stopped me from doing it.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:12.58,0:21:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Okay...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:15.28,0:21:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Miku. Isn't this place, like, {\i1}really{\i0} expensive?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:19.74,0:21:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I really should've dressed more properly.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:21.96,0:21:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:24.33,0:21:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You look handsome enough in what you're wearing, Darling.{The waiter is screaming inside}{totes}{#yeaaaaaart}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:28.34,0:21:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, that's not really the issue.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:37.78,0:21:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:39.75,0:21:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you nervous?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:42.12,0:21:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, s-sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:44.35,0:21:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,This will definitely be memorable experience,\N but it's still a little...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:48.49,0:21:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But we can't really go outside, either.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:53.36,0:21:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh dear, oh dear!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:55.02,0:21:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever shall I do?!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:57.25,0:21:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I know!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:58.62,0:22:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We could go outside if you\N weren't a {\i1}man{\i0}, couldn't we?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:02.48,0:22:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:03.31,0:22:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you look at that!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:05.12,0:22:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I just {\i1}happened{\i0} to have a \NRaizen High School girls' uniform with me!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:09.63,0:22:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hey, hold the phone! You want me to—
Dialogue: 10,0:22:12.21,0:22:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, I've had enough of that!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:15.99,0:22:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:17.95,0:22:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't want to, I won't force you.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:21.52,0:22:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,M-Miku...
Dialogue: 10,0:22:23.02,0:22:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It was the only way I could\N go outside with you, too...
Dialogue: 10,0:22:27.44,0:22:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,but I suppose that's that.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:31.22,0:22:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just have to give up.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:40.79,0:22:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,M-Miku, can we {\i1}please{\i0} go\N somewhere with less people?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:45.63,0:22:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter? \NWe're both {\i1}girls{\i0}, after all!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:50.05,0:22:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Dates can be like this too,\N can't they, Shiori-san?{TL: More like "Nobody said a date couldn't be like this, Shiori-san!" trying to force Shido to accept the fact that he is destined to be a trap for the rest of the day}
Dialogue: 10,0:22:54.12,0:22:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:57.64,0:23:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that the girl from the school festival?!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:00.33,0:23:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Itsuka-kun's cousin!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:01.69,0:23:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I could never find her after that,
Dialogue: 10,0:23:04.46,0:23:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,so I thought she must've transferred!{TL: The word is "transferred," but "moved" might be more natural here}{it's fine}
Dialogue: 10,0:23:06.70,0:23:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Gross!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:08.52,0:23:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Please let me through!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:10.16,0:23:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not after Miku-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:11.37,0:23:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to talk to that other girl!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:14.64,0:23:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow...
Dialogue: 10,0:23:24.29,0:23:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You look wonderful in anything!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:26.17,0:23:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,C-Come on, Miku!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:27.71,0:23:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to wear—
Dialogue: 10,0:23:29.34,0:23:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I {\i1}love{\i0} this one!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:31.76,0:23:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 10,0:23:32.65,0:23:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,you might have trouble putting it on by yourself.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:35.63,0:23:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Shiori-san, I'll help you get dressed!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:37.43,0:23:39.18,Alternative,,0,0,0,,H-Hey, wait—
Dialogue: 10,0:23:39.18,0:23:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, your underwear is adorable!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:41.23,0:23:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Have mercy!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:44.48,0:23:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,From that one to that one.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:46.98,0:23:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take all of those.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:48.35,0:23:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,M-Miku?!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:49.98,0:23:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,All of them, please!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:51.49,0:23:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Miku!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:52.49,0:23:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:55.41,0:23:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,There's still room at the top!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:57.15,0:23:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:57.74,0:23:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Easy. Over there!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:59.12,0:24:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that? Ethiopia!{fucking hell. they're using a gag that the voice actor of that fat guy does, where he says shit that sounds like names of countries.}
Dialogue: 10,0:24:01.34,0:24:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you like our date today, Darling?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:04.44,0:24:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I had lots of fun.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:06.79,0:24:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's so much work being a girl.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:12.51,0:24:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-This isn't...
Dialogue: 10,0:24:15.84,0:24:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody's there.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:17.71,0:24:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:20.88,0:24:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be seeing things, Darling.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:23.44,0:24:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I... I guess so.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:30.90,0:24:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I had so much fun today.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:34.04,0:24:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been so long since the two of us\N got to do anything alone.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:38.91,0:24:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:40.59,0:24:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We go to different schools, \Nand you're always busy with work.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:44.71,0:24:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we go on a date again?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:46.92,0:24:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, of course.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:49.11,0:24:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But... with less Shiori, please.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:53.65,0:24:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have to think about that!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:57.98,0:25:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Using a girl who's not Shido...{I don't really get what she means by this ###}
Dialogue: 10,0:25:00.32,0:25:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Miku has some radical thinking.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:02.40,0:25:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Shiori really is cute.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:04.99,0:25:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido should just dress that way all the time!
Dialogue: 10,0:25:08.36,0:25:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, Kaguya-chan, how's Yuzuru-chan getting on?
Dialogue: 10,0:25:11.74,0:25:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,She said she had to make\N some calls about her plan.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:20.06,0:25:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Request:
Dialogue: 10,0:25:21.58,0:25:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Origami, I would like \Nyour expertise in planning dates.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:27.98,0:25:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I know your true identity now.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:30.95,0:25:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot cooperate with a Spirit.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:33.45,0:25:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Plea: It is for a date with Shido.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:37.89,0:25:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,With Shido?
Dialogue: 10,0:25:39.36,0:25:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Contemplation: I need your help.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:45.12,0:25:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Step one: find a {fresh }Chinese soft-shelled turtle...{a common aphrodisiac}
Dialogue: 10,0:25:53.92,0:25:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You've gotten better at playing a girl.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:58.46,0:25:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Gimme a break!
Dialogue: 10,0:26:00.68,0:26:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got some news.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:02.24,0:26:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,As with Kaguya,
Dialogue: 10,0:26:03.50,0:26:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,we've observed a decline in \NMiku's signal from the sphere.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:09.39,0:26:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome. That's good to hear.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:12.46,0:26:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yoshino's up next, then after that Yuzuru,
Dialogue: 10,0:26:15.83,0:26:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,and then it's you, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:26:17.63,0:26:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:19.67,0:26:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a critical part of our plan\N to get rid of that object,
Dialogue: 10,0:26:22.59,0:26:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,and we've been making good progress so far.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:26.35,0:26:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd be, um...
Dialogue: 10,0:26:28.64,0:26:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm excited.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:29.98,0:26:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:26:30.80,0:26:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't really go on dates with you at all.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:33.48,0:26:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to it.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:35.05,0:26:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,H-How can you be so laid-back about this?
Dialogue: 10,0:26:37.65,0:26:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This is all happening because you said \Nthere was a huge ball in the sky!
Dialogue: 10,0:26:42.16,0:26:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Go take a bath!
Dialogue: 10,0:26:44.11,0:26:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I put in some bath salts.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:46.58,0:26:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger that.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:53.88,0:26:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Sheesh.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:00.93,0:27:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you find her?
Dialogue: 10,0:27:02.28,0:27:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:03.26,0:27:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems like she just vanished again.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:05.05,0:27:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,She isn't in any of the classes,
Dialogue: 10,0:27:07.68,0:27:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,and even though he's her cousin{relative}, \NItsuka-kun's as good as useless.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:10.81,0:27:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Gross.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:15.78,0:27:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido-san!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:17.82,0:27:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You came.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:21.22,0:27:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I did.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:22.82,0:27:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the only person who'd choose to meet up at a shrine.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:27.16,0:27:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not just {\i1}meeting{\i0} here!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:30.96,0:27:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido-san,
Dialogue: 10,0:27:33.20,0:27:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,do you remember this shrine?
Dialogue: 10,0:27:36.01,0:27:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, of course.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:51.73,0:27:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This is where we first met.
Dialogue: 10,0:28:01.24,0:28:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yoshino and I spent a lot of time thinking about what we should do for this date,{including slapping Yoshinon in the face to pray}{good plan}
Dialogue: 10,0:28:05.49,0:28:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,but in the end...
Dialogue: 10,0:28:08.98,0:28:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Rather than go somewhere else,
Dialogue: 10,0:28:10.51,0:28:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to spend time with you here.
Dialogue: 10,0:28:14.02,0:28:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it... no good?
Dialogue: 10,0:28:16.29,0:28:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,As if I'd think that!
Dialogue: 10,0:28:18.06,0:28:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go have fun!
Dialogue: 10,0:28:20.05,0:28:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Shido-san!
Dialogue: 10,0:28:22.64,0:28:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that great, Yoshino?
Dialogue: 10,0:28:24.46,0:28:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,0:28:25.64,0:28:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Rock, paper, scissors!
Dialogue: 10,0:28:28.24,0:28:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Chi, yo, ko, re, i, to.{FSCKING TRANSLITERATIONS}
Dialogue: 10,0:28:31.49,0:28:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Rock, paper, scissors!
Dialogue: 10,0:28:33.49,0:28:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Pa, i, na, tsu, pu, ru.{FSCKING TRANSLITERATIONS}
Dialogue: 10,0:28:36.40,0:28:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you ready?
Dialogue: 10,0:28:38.58,0:28:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ready!
Dialogue: 10,0:28:42.88,0:28:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a tough one, Yoshino.
Dialogue: 10,0:28:45.50,0:28:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:28:49.66,0:28:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Found you, Shido-san!
Dialogue: 10,0:28:52.21,0:28:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You got me!
Dialogue: 10,0:28:54.93,0:28:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yoshi-Yoshi-Yoshino...{"Yoshi Yoshi" being what people say when they pet people/animals}{blech}{holy fuck I just wrote up a TL note for the release post for the guriko game, I'm not doing another one}
Dialogue: 10,0:28:57.42,0:28:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 10,0:28:58.50,0:29:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do next?
Dialogue: 10,0:29:00.24,0:29:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Shido-kun!
Dialogue: 10,0:29:02.04,0:29:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yoshino's been looking at that thing a lot.
Dialogue: 10,0:29:05.10,0:29:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, fortunes.{omikuji}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.06,0:29:11.18,Sign #11,,0,0,0,,{\frz6\fax-0.1\fs27.75\fscy120\blur0.9\c&H6E62A2&\pos(1114.999,618.5)\clip(m 1020 622.5 l 1090.5 615 1104 615 1137 613.5 1174.5 610.5 1218 604.5 1233 673.5 1024.5 723 999 697.5)}Great Misfortune
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.56,0:29:11.68,Sign #11,,0,0,0,,{\frz1.7\fax-0.2\fs24\fscx110\fscy120\blur0.9\c&H87739F&\pos(1015.001,365)\clip(m 922.5 367.5 l 970.5 364.5 990 363 1015.5 360 1051.5 357 1090.5 355.5 1110 355.5 1101 417 909 457.5)}Great Misfortune
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.68,0:29:11.81,Sign #11,,0,0,0,,{\frz3.5\fax-0.1\fs28.5\blur0.9\c&H9C95E0&\pos(1024.5,351.5)\clip(m 922.5 355.5 l 1006.5 372 1260 354 1104 198 700.5 205.5)}Great Misfortune
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.68,0:29:11.81,Sign #11,,0,0,0,,{\frz3.5\fax-0.1\fs28.5\blur0.9\c&H8C73AA&\pos(1024.5,351.5)\iclip(m 922.5 355.5 l 1006.5 372 1260 354 1104 198 700.5 205.5)}Great Misfortune
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.81,0:29:11.93,Sign #11,,0,0,0,,{\frz4.2\fax0\fs28.5\blur0.9\c&H9C95E0&\pos(1030.001,338.5)}Great Misfortune
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.93,0:29:13.93,Sign #11,,0,0,0,,{\frz4.2\fax0.1\fs30\blur0.9\c&H9C95E0&\pos(1036.001,323)}Great Misfortune
Dialogue: 10,0:29:12.76,0:29:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Great misfortune...
Dialogue: 10,0:29:13.93,0:29:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, well.
Dialogue: 10,0:29:15.72,0:29:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What'd you get?
Dialogue: 10,0:29:16.98,0:29:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Great fortune!
Dialogue: 10,0:29:18.83,0:29:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 10,0:29:20.40,0:29:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I got that, too!
Dialogue: 10,0:29:22.44,0:29:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Get with the program, Shido-kun!
Dialogue: 10,0:29:26.24,0:29:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:29:50.18,0:29:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I had so much fun!
Dialogue: 10,0:29:51.72,0:29:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for everything.
Dialogue: 10,0:29:55.29,0:29:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And you, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:29:56.60,0:29:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That date was you all over.
Dialogue: 10,0:29:58.33,0:29:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I had a ball.
Dialogue: 10,0:30:00.48,0:30:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:30:29.90,0:30:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. That's another way to have a date.
Dialogue: 10,0:30:32.86,0:30:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It got pretty exciting!
Dialogue: 10,0:30:35.19,0:30:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:30:36.08,0:30:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 10,0:30:36.89,0:30:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the information, Yoshino and Yoshinon!
Dialogue: 10,0:30:39.48,0:30:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you, my plan has become a little more perfect!
Dialogue: 10,0:30:43.36,0:30:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to seeing what kind of\N date you have with Shido-kun, Tohka-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:30:47.58,0:30:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck!
Dialogue: 10,0:30:49.24,0:30:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me!
Dialogue: 10,0:30:52.04,0:30:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuzuru, the bath's free.
Dialogue: 10,0:30:53.99,0:30:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Confirmation: I will have one in a bit.
Dialogue: 10,0:30:57.87,0:31:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Decision: I mustn't rely on Master Origami all the time.
Dialogue: 10,0:31:07.71,0:31:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Respect: Master Origami is truly amazing.
Dialogue: 10,0:31:11.58,0:31:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}However, in order to surpass her,
Dialogue: 10,0:31:14.57,0:31:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I cannot just follow.
Dialogue: 10,0:31:18.88,0:31:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Determination: I'll add my own twist.
Dialogue: 10,0:31:24.30,0:31:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Arrival:
Dialogue: 10,0:31:26.23,0:31:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you wait, Shido?
Dialogue: 10,0:31:28.65,0:31:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Morning, Yuzuru.
Dialogue: 10,0:31:30.79,0:31:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You seem a little different from usual. I'm surprised.
Dialogue: 10,0:31:33.92,0:31:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Worry: Do I look strange?
Dialogue: 10,0:31:36.49,0:31:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you look great.
Dialogue: 10,0:31:39.73,0:31:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido's saying the same thing he said to me!
Dialogue: 10,0:31:43.04,0:31:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Because Yuzuru-chan asked the same thing you did!
Dialogue: 10,0:31:46.78,0:31:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Like, "do I look strange?"
Dialogue: 10,0:31:48.25,0:31:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You are twins, after all.
Dialogue: 10,0:31:51.15,0:31:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll put that in my notes.
