Dialogue: 10,0:32:12.51,0:32:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This way, Shido.
Dialogue: 10,0:32:14.38,0:32:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? O-Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:32:16.56,0:32:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,A-A gallery?
Dialogue: 10,0:32:18.53,0:32:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Inquiry: Shido, is this an art museum?
Dialogue: 10,0:32:21.70,0:32:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You came in without knowing?
Dialogue: 10,0:32:23.76,0:32:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a gallery.
Dialogue: 10,0:32:24.98,0:32:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,They do small showcases and\N sell some of the art on display.
Dialogue: 10,0:32:29.94,0:32:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Comprehension: It feels kind of nice.{TL: "It puts me at ease" could be better}
Dialogue: 10,0:32:37.52,0:32:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Modification: More twist.
Dialogue: 10,0:32:40.88,0:32:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Awe: What a large selection.
Dialogue: 10,0:32:44.06,0:32:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot believe they're all the same price.
Dialogue: 10,0:32:46.99,0:32:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's pretty cool.
Dialogue: 10,0:32:51.42,0:32:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Request:
Dialogue: 10,0:32:52.86,0:32:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido, I want this.
Dialogue: 10,0:32:56.10,0:32:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 10,0:32:57.08,0:33:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't stop you, but you know \Nit's not anything fancy, right?{are you okay with something so cheap?}
Dialogue: 10,0:33:03.04,0:33:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Appreciation: Thank you, Shido.
Dialogue: 10,0:33:06.62,0:33:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't mention it.
Dialogue: 10,0:33:08.43,0:33:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It suits you.
