Dialogue: 10,0:33:14.83,0:33:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are we going next?
Dialogue: 10,0:33:19.66,0:33:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\t(5320,5770,\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}Bring him to room 603 of the Tengu\N JSDF Hospital for a "health checkup."
Dialogue: 10,0:33:26.77,0:33:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuzuru?
Dialogue: 10,0:33:27.84,0:33:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Modification: More twist.
Dialogue: 10,0:33:31.28,0:33:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Wha—
Dialogue: 10,0:33:32.27,0:33:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hold on, Yuzuru!
Dialogue: 10,0:33:34.14,0:33:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Wha— Yuzuru-san?!
Dialogue: 10,0:33:37.74,0:33:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Origami-san!
Dialogue: 10,0:33:40.42,0:33:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We came to see you—
Dialogue: 10,0:33:56.95,0:33:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What is this, Origami-san?!
Dialogue: 10,0:33:59.60,0:34:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not the one.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:00.91,0:34:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not {\i1}what{\i0} one?!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:03.56,0:34:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Appreciation: Thank you for everything, Shido.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:07.23,0:34:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Same.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:09.50,0:34:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That last bit really took me by surprise, though.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:12.65,0:34:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Apology: I did not, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.86,0:34:19.86,Sign #6,,0,0,0,,{\fs37.5\blur4.5\c&HDFE5CC&\pos(963.3,471.9)\alpha&H80&}Vacant
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.86,0:34:19.86,Sign #6,,0,0,0,,{\fs37.5\blur1.05\c&H5F697D&\pos(963.3,626.4)}Full
Dialogue: 1,0:34:12.86,0:34:19.86,Sign #6,,0,0,0,,{\fs37.5\blur0.75\c&HDFE5CC&\pos(963.3,471.9)}Vacant
Dialogue: 10,0:34:15.57,0:34:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know that it was {\i1}that{\i0} sort of thing.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:18.28,0:34:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:23.02,0:34:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Promise:
Dialogue: 10,0:34:24.61,0:34:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take good care of this.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:38.22,0:34:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,How's the sphere looking?
Dialogue: 10,0:34:40.43,0:34:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No glaring issues.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:42.04,0:34:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The signals resembling those of Kaguya, \NMiku, Yoshino, and Yuzuru have all faded.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:48.06,0:34:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You're up next, Commander!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:51.33,0:34:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What?
Dialogue: 10,0:34:52.44,0:34:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course we're all getting excited.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:55.02,0:34:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of date will you and Shido have?
Dialogue: 10,0:34:58.28,0:35:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Lately, all we talk about is \Nhow we think your date will go.
