Dialogue: 10,0:35:09.16,0:35:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Cease your foolishness at once!
Dialogue: 10,0:35:11.17,0:35:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood!
Dialogue: 10,0:35:15.86,0:35:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no need to be shy!
Dialogue: 10,0:35:18.30,0:35:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,As a sister myself, I'm rooting for you all the way!
Dialogue: 10,0:35:21.53,0:35:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,G-God, give me a break!
Dialogue: 10,0:35:26.62,0:35:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow...
Dialogue: 10,0:35:30.93,0:35:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I just don't know what to do.
Dialogue: 10,0:35:32.87,0:35:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,An older member in the play is in hospital right now, \Nbut she just wouldn't listen to me.
Dialogue: 10,0:35:37.24,0:35:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,There's someone like that{one of those} in my class, too!
Dialogue: 10,0:35:39.58,0:35:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,They really should stay there,\N but they just keep slipping out!
Dialogue: 10,0:35:42.45,0:35:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Some people can be a real handful, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:35:44.75,0:35:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,No kidding!
Dialogue: 10,0:35:46.33,0:35:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kotori.
Dialogue: 10,0:35:47.49,0:35:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this really all you wanted to do?
Dialogue: 10,0:35:49.41,0:35:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:35:50.80,0:35:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, minced meat.
Dialogue: 10,0:35:55.09,0:35:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,How's this?
Dialogue: 10,0:35:58.51,0:36:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We haven't done this in a while, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:36:00.84,0:36:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I think anything out of the ordinary\N is fair game for a date.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:04.68,0:36:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Fair enough.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:05.99,0:36:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,So long as you're happy.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:07.39,0:36:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 10,0:36:10.36,0:36:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,A new flavor!
Dialogue: 10,0:36:12.39,0:36:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I buy one?{ONE? who are you and what have you done with Kotori?}
Dialogue: 10,0:36:15.15,0:36:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Shido!
Dialogue: 10,0:36:19.70,0:36:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't those heavy?
Dialogue: 10,0:36:21.59,0:36:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, I'm used to this.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:23.81,0:36:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I can hold one.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:25.04,0:36:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:26.14,0:36:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about me.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:29.43,0:36:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Gimme a sec.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:37.32,0:36:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm {\i1}definitely{\i0} taking one!
Dialogue: 10,0:36:39.28,0:36:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hey!
Dialogue: 10,0:36:41.09,0:36:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Onii-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:36:45.24,0:36:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:57.64,0:37:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Kotori's date is around Salisbury steak.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:00.29,0:37:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so... scrumptious.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:02.11,0:37:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,A dine-in date!{date at home}
Dialogue: 10,0:37:04.11,0:37:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Kotori-chan looks like she's having a blast!
Dialogue: 10,0:37:06.66,0:37:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at this, Onii-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:37:08.49,0:37:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow. Is that a raccoon dog?
Dialogue: 10,0:37:10.64,0:37:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a bunny!{I thought it was a bear tbh}
Dialogue: 10,0:37:12.16,0:37:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:13.79,0:37:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll forgive you if you make my steak twice as big.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:23.19,0:37:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:24.64,0:37:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Not before dinner.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:28.18,0:37:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 10,0:37:40.99,0:37:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,All right,
Dialogue: 10,0:37:42.53,0:37:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,dinner is served.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:43.69,0:37:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay, Salisbury steak!
Dialogue: 10,0:37:46.56,0:37:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It smells so good.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:48.48,0:37:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oof... Hey, snap out of it!
Dialogue: 10,0:37:51.70,0:37:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Kotori's date.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:53.56,0:37:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't get in their way.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:56.85,0:37:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,But it smells so... ah...
Dialogue: 10,0:38:01.12,0:38:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing over there, Tohka, Yoshino?
Dialogue: 10,0:38:03.96,0:38:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we made some for you, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:38:09.30,0:38:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the grub!{Itadakimasu!}
Dialogue: 10,0:38:13.57,0:38:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's delicious, Shido!
Dialogue: 10,0:38:21.19,0:38:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Great cooking, as usual.
Dialogue: 10,0:38:22.64,0:38:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't do anything special, though.
Dialogue: 10,0:38:25.21,0:38:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I should get some dressing.
Dialogue: 10,0:38:33.99,0:38:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-You're...
Dialogue: 10,0:38:36.19,0:38:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido?
Dialogue: 10,0:38:37.84,0:38:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 10,0:38:38.67,0:38:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I just...
Dialogue: 10,0:38:56.45,0:38:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Who was that?
Dialogue: 10,0:38:58.59,0:39:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Curious?
Dialogue: 10,0:39:04.51,0:39:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuru-Kuru-mi!
Dialogue: 10,0:39:06.74,0:39:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Kurumi!
Dialogue: 10,0:39:07.58,0:39:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You needn't be so sour.
Dialogue: 10,0:39:09.98,0:39:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Have we not helped each other in the past?
Dialogue: 10,0:39:13.72,0:39:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You after something?{You have some business?}
Dialogue: 10,0:39:15.03,0:39:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 10,0:39:16.25,0:39:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,There are all these mysterious things happening around you lately.
Dialogue: 10,0:39:21.86,0:39:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I have simply come to see them for myself.
Dialogue: 10,0:39:25.41,0:39:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Kurumi. You can see that thing?!
Dialogue: 10,0:39:28.42,0:39:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And from what you've said,
Dialogue: 10,0:39:30.40,0:39:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I take it that you too are able to see it.
Dialogue: 10,0:39:34.17,0:39:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, Kurumi.
Dialogue: 10,0:39:35.69,0:39:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 10,0:39:37.00,0:39:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can nobody else see it?
Dialogue: 10,0:39:38.84,0:39:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That is not a short story to tell.
Dialogue: 10,0:39:41.66,0:39:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What I {\i1}can{\i0} tell you is that you are\N not mistaken in your actions.
Dialogue: 10,0:39:46.69,0:39:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean by going on dates with everyone?
Dialogue: 10,0:39:50.43,0:39:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my. It seems as though you have a guest.
Dialogue: 10,0:39:54.11,0:39:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall leave it at that for today.
Dialogue: 10,0:39:56.58,0:39:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You're...
Dialogue: 10,0:39:57.40,0:40:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I will give you one final piece of advice, Shido-san.
Dialogue: 10,0:40:01.20,0:40:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The human heart—even one's own—is unpredictable.
Dialogue: 10,0:40:06.21,0:40:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care.
Dialogue: 10,0:40:09.79,0:40:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Kurumi...
Dialogue: 10,0:40:12.88,0:40:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:40:15.34,0:40:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 10,0:40:16.16,0:40:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Shido!
Dialogue: 10,0:40:18.14,0:40:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I've finally finished the plan for my date!
Dialogue: 10,0:40:21.06,0:40:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I can guarantee you'll love it!
Dialogue: 10,0:40:23.42,0:40:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,G-Great!
Dialogue: 10,0:40:25.92,0:40:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The show's starting, Tohka-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:40:29.22,0:40:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Be right there!
Dialogue: 10,0:40:30.27,0:40:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,See you later, Shido!
Dialogue: 10,0:40:32.54,0:40:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, whatever.
Dialogue: 10,0:40:34.17,0:40:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I've still got unanswered questions,
Dialogue: 10,0:40:36.00,0:40:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,but for now, I should just\N enjoy my date with Tohka.
Dialogue: 10,0:40:42.86,0:40:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are, Shido!
Dialogue: 10,0:40:44.25,0:40:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Tohka!
Dialogue: 10,0:40:45.10,0:40:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry! Did I make you wait?
Dialogue: 10,0:40:46.81,0:40:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not at all!
Dialogue: 10,0:40:48.50,0:40:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at Tohka-chan trying to make him feel better.
Dialogue: 10,0:40:51.00,0:40:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,She's been restlessly waiting here for a whole hour!
Dialogue: 10,0:40:54.60,0:40:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Even Darling is 15 minutes early.
Dialogue: 10,0:40:59.22,0:41:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been watching her since\N she got here, so we're no better.
Dialogue: 10,0:41:02.69,0:41:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You dressed up for the date.
Dialogue: 10,0:41:04.81,0:41:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You look great!
Dialogue: 10,0:41:07.08,0:41:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I do?
Dialogue: 10,0:41:10.27,0:41:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Shido!
Dialogue: 10,0:41:11.50,0:41:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna make this our best day ever!
Dialogue: 10,0:41:14.27,0:41:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to it.
Dialogue: 10,0:41:19.87,0:41:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Tohka-chan's date has commenced!
Dialogue: 10,0:41:22.29,0:41:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,According to our theories,
Dialogue: 10,0:41:23.92,0:41:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,after Tohka's date, the invisible sphere will lose its energy
Dialogue: 10,0:41:27.76,0:41:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,and disappear completely.
Dialogue: 10,0:41:29.69,0:41:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 10,0:41:30.78,0:41:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:41:32.00,0:41:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Judging from the data we've\N gathered so far{our past data}, that's highly likely.
Dialogue: 10,0:41:36.44,0:41:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But we couldn't really find out anything more about the object, could we?
Dialogue: 10,0:41:41.98,0:41:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I would've liked to know more about it as well.
