Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.44,0:41:54.48,Sign #6,,0,0,0,,{\fax0.1\blur0.9\fs63\1c&H8876DF&\pos(827.49,-18.6)}Famous Fried Soup Dumplings
Dialogue: 10,0:41:55.34,0:41:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,First, we'll have...
Dialogue: 10,0:41:56.48,0:41:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,these!
Dialogue: 10,0:42:00.30,0:42:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,They're so good!
Dialogue: 10,0:42:02.26,0:42:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,My turn, then.
Dialogue: 10,0:42:04.83,0:42:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hot!
Dialogue: 10,0:42:06.49,0:42:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right, Shido?!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.58,0:42:15.59,Sign #6,,0,0,0,,{\fax0.2\blur0.9\fs33\frz6\c&H7578F0&\pos(474.6,63.3)}Famous Fried Soup Dumplings
Dialogue: 10,0:42:10.83,0:42:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-Thanks, Tohka.
Dialogue: 10,0:42:13.12,0:42:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just glad you're okay.{including "um" because lol wakarimasen}
Dialogue: 10,0:42:15.59,0:42:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,So, where are we going for today's date?
Dialogue: 10,0:42:18.64,0:42:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to that takoyaki place next!{including "um" because lol wakarimasen}{lol it's not even "um"}
Dialogue: 10,0:42:22.19,0:42:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:42:22.97,0:42:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we'll have skewers,
Dialogue: 10,0:42:24.59,0:42:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,crêpes, yakisoba, snow cones,
Dialogue: 10,0:42:26.83,0:42:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,calamari, and corn dogs!
Dialogue: 10,0:42:29.28,0:42:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, Tohka.
Dialogue: 10,0:42:30.67,0:42:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We're just going to eat?
Dialogue: 10,0:42:32.32,0:42:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 10,0:42:33.12,0:42:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,After observing all of your dates, I found...
Dialogue: 10,0:42:36.85,0:42:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,that nobody ate nearly enough on their dates!
Dialogue: 10,0:42:41.22,0:42:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Salisbury steak was great, though!
Dialogue: 10,0:42:43.40,0:42:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 10,0:42:44.65,0:42:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why {\i1}my{\i0} date...
Dialogue: 10,0:42:47.72,0:42:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,is {\i1}all{\i0} about eating stuff with you!
Dialogue: 10,0:42:55.39,0:42:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't like it?
Dialogue: 10,0:42:57.28,0:43:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I-It's not that. I was just a bit surprised.
Dialogue: 10,0:43:00.59,0:43:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Tohka.
Dialogue: 10,0:43:01.63,0:43:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll stick with you till the very end!
Dialogue: 10,0:43:03.47,0:43:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,0:43:06.16,0:43:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse us, two large bowls please!{large servings}{TL: Question mark???}{let's avoid the issue by not making it a question. normally yes, but it's kinda weird.}
Dialogue: 10,0:43:23.38,0:43:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here, Origami-san!
Dialogue: 10,0:43:26.06,0:43:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We got the stuff you asked for.
Dialogue: 10,0:43:30.88,0:43:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Origami-san?
Dialogue: 10,0:43:33.67,0:43:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No luck finding her, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:43:36.42,0:43:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The phantom student...
Dialogue: 10,0:43:38.44,0:43:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's almost like a horror movie.
Dialogue: 10,0:43:39.88,0:43:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Gross.
Dialogue: 10,0:43:41.60,0:43:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry...
