Dialogue: 10,0:43:46.52,0:43:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Gross.{LMFAO}
Dialogue: 10,0:43:50.08,0:43:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,This is... This is great, Shido!
Dialogue: 10,0:43:52.27,0:43:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it was worth the long wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:43:55.09,0:43:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You really do know your food!
Dialogue: 10,0:43:56.91,0:43:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,R-Really?
Dialogue: 10,0:44:00.05,0:44:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this, Shido!
Dialogue: 10,0:44:02.28,0:44:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure?
Dialogue: 10,0:44:03.72,0:44:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Have some of mine, then.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:06.03,0:44:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 10,0:44:06.91,0:44:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Shido!
Dialogue: 10,0:44:09.84,0:44:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, we're out.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:13.48,0:44:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank y—
Dialogue: 10,0:44:18.62,0:44:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Shido?
Dialogue: 10,0:44:20.12,0:44:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I—
Dialogue: 10,0:44:21.83,0:44:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:23.97,0:44:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Found you.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:26.59,0:44:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Origami?!
Dialogue: 10,0:44:27.80,0:44:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, you sneaky little...
Dialogue: 10,0:44:30.23,0:44:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you come for your checkup?
Dialogue: 10,0:44:32.60,0:44:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,My what?
Dialogue: 10,0:44:33.85,0:44:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you. Don't ignore me!
Dialogue: 10,0:44:36.03,0:44:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Your health is extremely important.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:38.01,0:44:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You are required to receive a checkup by me.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:41.31,0:44:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-You're making even less\N sense than usual, Origami-san.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:46.49,0:44:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It's required.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:48.03,0:44:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 10,0:44:48.99,0:44:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Required.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:50.30,0:44:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Like I said...
Dialogue: 10,0:44:51.37,0:44:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Required.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:52.83,0:44:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:54.83,0:44:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I told you not to ignore me!
Dialogue: 10,0:44:57.76,0:45:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido and I are on a date right now!
Dialogue: 10,0:45:00.00,0:45:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of our way!
Dialogue: 10,0:45:01.79,0:45:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one "getting in the way"\N of Shido's good health.
Dialogue: 10,0:45:06.42,0:45:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,There she is!
Dialogue: 10,0:45:07.76,0:45:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Origami!
Dialogue: 10,0:45:09.16,0:45:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you out here?!
Dialogue: 10,0:45:11.61,0:45:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We're taking you back to the hospital!
Dialogue: 10,0:45:20.19,0:45:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:45:21.16,0:45:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You're supposed to be severely injured!
Dialogue: 10,0:45:25.12,0:45:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with her?
Dialogue: 10,0:45:27.04,0:45:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that girl...
Dialogue: 10,0:45:59.98,0:46:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,No better place to end a date.
Dialogue: 10,0:46:03.19,0:46:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:46:04.85,0:46:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a place...
Dialogue: 10,0:46:06.98,0:46:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,where we share treasured memories.
Dialogue: 10,0:46:13.17,0:46:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The sphere's Spirit waves are steadily decreasing.
Dialogue: 10,0:46:15.85,0:46:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,At this rate, it will vanish completely in 2 minutes!
Dialogue: 10,0:46:19.24,0:46:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The invisible sphere...
Dialogue: 10,0:46:21.75,0:46:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess it stayed that way till the end.
Dialogue: 10,0:46:26.80,0:46:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I had lots of fun today, Shido.
Dialogue: 10,0:46:30.30,0:46:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 10,0:46:31.72,0:46:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I did, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:46:34.89,0:46:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Shido.
Dialogue: 10,0:46:36.22,0:46:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go home before it gets dark.
Dialogue: 10,0:46:38.17,0:46:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What's for dinner?
Dialogue: 10,0:46:39.74,0:46:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I could go for some curry!
Dialogue: 10,0:46:41.91,0:46:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We just had curry.
Dialogue: 10,0:46:54.11,0:46:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you...
Dialogue: 10,0:46:58.70,0:47:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you looking at, Shido?
Dialogue: 10,0:47:01.66,0:47:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't see her?!
Dialogue: 10,0:47:02.56,0:47:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,See who?
Dialogue: 10,0:47:04.80,0:47:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Tohka, I'm sorry to do this during our date,
Dialogue: 10,0:47:07.93,0:47:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,but can you give me a minute?
Dialogue: 10,0:47:09.15,0:47:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, go ahead.
Dialogue: 10,0:47:13.84,0:47:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 10,0:47:15.76,0:47:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What's Shido doing?
Dialogue: 10,0:47:17.91,0:47:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done.
Dialogue: 10,0:47:20.93,0:47:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Cherubiel and I didn't have to intervene.
Dialogue: 10,0:47:23.92,0:47:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Cherubiel?
Dialogue: 10,0:47:25.44,0:47:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that your...
Dialogue: 10,0:47:27.44,0:47:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me!
Dialogue: 10,0:47:28.64,0:47:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you?
Dialogue: 10,0:47:29.90,0:47:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you want with me?
Dialogue: 10,0:47:32.32,0:47:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Mayuri,
Dialogue: 10,0:47:34.24,0:47:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Cherubiel's operating persona.
Dialogue: 10,0:47:36.28,0:47:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Tohka-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:47:37.49,0:47:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you were all here!
Dialogue: 10,0:47:40.19,0:47:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:47:41.40,0:47:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what's Shido doing out there?
Dialogue: 10,0:47:43.32,0:47:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Concern: He's talking to himself.
Dialogue: 10,0:47:46.59,0:47:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe he's just tired.
Dialogue: 10,0:47:49.46,0:47:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,When there's a high concentration of Spirit energy somewhere,
Dialogue: 10,0:47:53.26,0:47:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I am born in order to judge\N if its vessel can contain it.
Dialogue: 10,0:47:59.44,0:48:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Vessel...
Dialogue: 10,0:48:00.72,0:48:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean me?
Dialogue: 10,0:48:03.38,0:48:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,My observations have led us to conclude that the system does not need to be activated.
Dialogue: 10,0:48:09.57,0:48:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Me and Cherubiel are done with our work here.{job done}
Dialogue: 10,0:48:12.43,0:48:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Your work is done?{jobs are}
Dialogue: 10,0:48:14.61,0:48:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:48:15.50,0:48:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, we will decompose our existence
Dialogue: 10,0:48:18.48,0:48:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,and return to nothingness.
Dialogue: 10,0:48:20.79,0:48:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?!
Dialogue: 10,0:48:22.96,0:48:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would you...
Dialogue: 10,0:48:24.56,0:48:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't ask me.
Dialogue: 10,0:48:26.89,0:48:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We vanish if we reach a conclusion.
Dialogue: 10,0:48:29.36,0:48:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how it works.
Dialogue: 10,0:48:31.93,0:48:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all there is to it.
Dialogue: 10,0:48:37.18,0:48:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 10,0:48:39.31,0:48:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,for some reason,
Dialogue: 10,0:48:42.31,0:48:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to talk to you before I went.
Dialogue: 10,0:48:44.86,0:48:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Wait, Mayuri!
Dialogue: 10,0:49:11.56,0:49:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Shido.
Dialogue: 10,0:49:18.36,0:49:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?!
Dialogue: 10,0:49:19.23,0:49:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Light: It's blinding!
Dialogue: 10,0:49:39.95,0:49:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Cherubiel!
Dialogue: 10,0:49:41.15,0:49:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 10,0:49:52.46,0:49:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido!
Dialogue: 10,0:49:55.57,0:49:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Status report!
Dialogue: 10,0:49:56.96,0:49:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Sh-Shido-kun...
Dialogue: 10,0:49:59.09,0:50:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,is safe!
Dialogue: 10,0:50:01.73,0:50:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the heck is {\i1}that{\i0}?!
Dialogue: 10,0:50:02.91,0:50:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We can see the sphere!
Dialogue: 10,0:50:04.11,0:50:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's armed!
Dialogue: 10,0:50:05.21,0:50:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,These values, it's...
Dialogue: 10,0:50:07.52,0:50:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,an Angel!{"Yet another gargantuan menace of unknown origin descends upon Tokyo-3"}
Dialogue: 10,0:50:10.31,0:50:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What in the world is going on, Shido?
Dialogue: 10,0:50:13.15,0:50:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And who is that girl who appeared out of nowhere?
Dialogue: 10,0:50:16.42,0:50:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I'll explain later...\N as best as I can, that is.
Dialogue: 10,0:50:20.78,0:50:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Incoming!
Dialogue: 10,0:50:31.42,0:50:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Enemy expanding attack area!
Dialogue: 10,0:50:33.32,0:50:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,They won't get the spacequake warning in time!{warning wont make it}
Dialogue: 10,0:50:35.76,0:50:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Kannazuki!
Dialogue: 10,0:50:36.67,0:50:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Right beside you!
Dialogue: 10,0:50:38.05,0:50:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Disable invisibility!
Dialogue: 10,0:50:39.88,0:50:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Redirect magical power to Yggdra-Folium!
Dialogue: 10,0:50:50.47,0:50:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Launch all Yggdra-Folia!
Dialogue: 10,0:51:01.53,0:51:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Bound warp!
Dialogue: 10,0:51:10.46,0:51:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, darn it!
Dialogue: 10,0:51:11.96,0:51:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't stand being stuck on the defensive!
Dialogue: 10,0:51:14.51,0:51:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Yuzuru!
Dialogue: 10,0:51:16.48,0:51:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Concurrence: I was thinking the same thing, Kaguya.
Dialogue: 10,0:51:20.64,0:51:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going with them!
Dialogue: 10,0:51:22.12,0:51:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too!
Dialogue: 10,0:51:23.36,0:51:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 10,0:51:24.43,0:51:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful!
Dialogue: 10,0:51:26.64,0:51:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about us.
Dialogue: 10,0:51:34.85,0:51:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, I'll just...
Dialogue: 10,0:51:44.78,0:51:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,...protect you, Darling!
Dialogue: 10,0:51:46.81,0:51:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-Thanks, Miku.
Dialogue: 10,0:51:49.08,0:51:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Cherubiel...
Dialogue: 10,0:51:50.71,0:51:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 10,0:51:51.94,0:51:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The vessel has earned our approval,
Dialogue: 10,0:51:54.12,0:51:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,so why are you...
Dialogue: 10,0:51:55.71,0:51:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What's her deal?
Dialogue: 10,0:51:58.00,0:51:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, uh...
Dialogue: 10,0:52:30.50,0:52:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no good!
Dialogue: 10,0:52:31.69,0:52:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Concurrence: We need a plan{to find a way}.
Dialogue: 10,0:52:34.08,0:52:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of the way, girls.
Dialogue: 10,0:52:36.50,0:52:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll end this fast.
Dialogue: 10,0:52:38.64,0:52:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Convergent Magic Cannon, Misteltein!{whatever we named it before}{It was some shit like that}{close}
Dialogue: 10,0:52:40.67,0:52:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to fire!
Dialogue: 10,0:52:41.69,0:52:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 10,0:52:42.91,0:52:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Misteltein, fire at maximum power!
Dialogue: 10,0:52:58.61,0:53:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The Misteltein had no effect!
Dialogue: 10,0:53:16.66,0:53:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri!
Dialogue: 10,0:53:17.23,0:53:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Let her go!
Dialogue: 10,0:53:27.63,0:53:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri!
Dialogue: 10,0:53:32.75,0:53:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Ch-Cherubiel?
Dialogue: 10,0:53:34.24,0:53:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 10,0:53:40.72,0:53:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 10,0:53:43.44,0:53:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Just...
Dialogue: 10,0:53:44.74,0:53:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,stop already!{-already}
Dialogue: 10,0:53:45.72,0:53:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Cherubiel!
Dialogue: 10,0:53:48.57,0:53:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you...
Dialogue: 10,0:53:51.62,0:53:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Their emotions {\i1}should{\i0} be stable.
Dialogue: 10,0:53:55.94,0:53:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}These emotions...
Dialogue: 10,0:54:00.10,0:54:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The Angel has captured what appears to be a Spirit!
Dialogue: 10,0:54:03.36,0:54:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Spirit energy is still increasing!
Dialogue: 10,0:54:05.24,0:54:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Its attacks are getting stronger!
Dialogue: 10,0:54:08.16,0:54:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't just sit here and watch!
Dialogue: 10,0:54:10.24,0:54:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful out there, Mana!
Dialogue: 10,0:54:12.30,0:54:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is even going on?
Dialogue: 10,0:54:13.69,0:54:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Tohka's date was going perfectly fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:54:16.73,0:54:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did this happen?
Dialogue: 10,0:54:18.54,0:54:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,C-Commander!
Dialogue: 10,0:54:19.74,0:54:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The object's signals are changing!
Dialogue: 10,0:54:21.85,0:54:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,There's another signal emerging that's\N different from the ones we've eliminated!
Dialogue: 10,0:54:28.00,0:54:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that...
Dialogue: 10,0:54:29.91,0:54:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,These emotions aren't theirs...
Dialogue: 10,0:54:33.26,0:54:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,They're...
Dialogue: 10,0:54:38.99,0:54:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,my own?!
Dialogue: 10,0:54:40.96,0:54:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Jealously.
Dialogue: 10,0:54:42.71,0:54:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Because its Spirit is having unexpected emotions, the Angel has gone berserk.
Dialogue: 10,0:54:48.30,0:54:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, does she like Shido, too?{heyyo kotori}
Dialogue: 10,0:54:51.38,0:54:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 10,0:54:52.62,0:54:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll just destroy it.
Dialogue: 10,0:54:54.56,0:54:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Mana?
Dialogue: 10,0:54:58.48,0:55:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever the cause, it'll wreck the city if we don't stop it.
Dialogue: 10,0:55:03.68,0:55:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,If it neutralizes your cannon...
Dialogue: 10,0:55:06.73,0:55:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just attack it directly!
Dialogue: 10,0:55:10.37,0:55:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:55:11.45,0:55:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Nii-sama?!
Dialogue: 10,0:55:12.80,0:55:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Mana!
Dialogue: 10,0:55:13.97,0:55:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait until I save Mayuri!
Dialogue: 10,0:55:16.12,0:55:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll find a way!
Dialogue: 10,0:55:17.45,0:55:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me help her!
Dialogue: 10,0:55:19.15,0:55:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido?!
Dialogue: 10,0:55:20.08,0:55:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,She was—Mayuri was born from everybody's Spirit energy!
Dialogue: 10,0:55:25.47,0:55:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Tohka's,
Dialogue: 10,0:55:26.71,0:55:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yoshino's,
Dialogue: 10,0:55:28.60,0:55:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaguya's,
Dialogue: 10,0:55:29.72,0:55:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuzuru's,
Dialogue: 10,0:55:31.47,0:55:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Miku's,
Dialogue: 10,0:55:33.24,0:55:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,and yours!
Dialogue: 10,0:55:35.14,0:55:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri is made of all of you!
Dialogue: 10,0:55:38.54,0:55:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,She told me that she'd vanish\N once her job was done—
Dialogue: 10,0:55:42.68,0:55:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,that that's the only reason she was born.
Dialogue: 10,0:55:45.15,0:55:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody should be born just to disappear.
Dialogue: 10,0:55:48.68,0:55:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially if this rampage is a sign\N she doesn't want to vanish!
Dialogue: 10,0:55:53.44,0:55:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to save her...
Dialogue: 10,0:55:55.49,0:55:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to save all of you!
Dialogue: 10,0:56:02.09,0:56:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 10,0:56:04.70,0:56:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be—
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.36,0:56:45.76,OP-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}dare mo ga utsumuku machi (Dead or Alive)
Dialogue: 1,0:56:40.36,0:56:45.76,OP-Romaji,,0,0,105,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}A dry wind blows
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.76,0:56:50.74,OP-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}kawaita kaze fukinuketeku
Dialogue: 1,0:56:45.76,0:56:50.74,OP-Romaji,,0,0,105,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}through the streets of a forsaken town.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.10,0:56:56.62,OP-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}hikari motometa hitomi (Dead or Alive)
Dialogue: 1,0:56:51.10,0:56:56.62,OP-Romaji,,0,0,105,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}My eyes seek the light
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.62,0:57:01.94,OP-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}utsuru no wa zetsubou dake
Dialogue: 1,0:56:56.62,0:57:01.94,OP-Romaji,,0,0,105,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}yet only see despair.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.94,0:57:06.72,OP-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}dare ni mo todokanai sakebi
Dialogue: 1,0:57:01.94,0:57:06.72,OP-Romaji,,0,0,105,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}I scream out into nothingness.
Dialogue: 10,0:57:03.54,0:57:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on, Reine?
Dialogue: 10,0:57:05.31,0:57:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't be certain,
Dialogue: 10,0:57:07.18,0:57:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,but I think it's because what Shin said resonated with all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.26,0:57:11.15,OP-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}sagasu sono te de tomete
Dialogue: 1,0:57:07.26,0:57:11.15,OP-Romaji,,0,0,105,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}Please find me and make it stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.15,0:57:16.92,OP-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}nani mo kamo kowareta sekai de wake mo wakaranai mama ni
Dialogue: 1,0:57:11.15,0:57:16.92,OP-Romaji,,0,0,105,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}In this broken world, I can't tell black from white,
Dialogue: 10,0:57:11.24,0:57:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Reine-san.
Dialogue: 10,0:57:12.30,0:57:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how long it'll last,
Dialogue: 10,0:57:14.80,0:57:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,but it's the best chance we've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.92,0:57:22.00,OP-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}fureta yasashisa ga mada kowakute
Dialogue: 1,0:57:16.92,0:57:22.00,OP-Romaji,,0,0,105,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}so I'm still wary of the kindness you show me.
Dialogue: 10,0:57:17.31,0:57:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Kotori, Miku, please help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.00,0:57:30.09,OP-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}ana no aita kokoro no sukima umetekureru hito wa kimi nano
Dialogue: 1,0:57:22.00,0:57:30.09,OP-Romaji,,0,0,105,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}I wonder if your love will fill this gap in my heart
Dialogue: 10,0:57:22.72,0:57:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, let's do it.
Dialogue: 10,0:57:26.68,0:57:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Let our date begin.{use line from tv series}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.71,0:57:34.34,OP-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}erande Date A Live
Dialogue: 1,0:57:30.71,0:57:34.34,OP-Romaji,,0,0,105,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}Make your choice—Date A Live.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.71,0:57:53.11,OP-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}shizuka ni uzuku itami (Dead or Alive)
Dialogue: 1,0:57:47.71,0:57:53.11,OP-Romaji,,0,0,105,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}A dull pain throbs
Dialogue: 10,0:57:47.98,0:57:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Tohka!
Dialogue: 10,0:57:48.83,0:57:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone!
Dialogue: 10,0:57:49.69,0:57:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido!
Dialogue: 10,0:57:51.66,0:57:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.11,0:57:58.36,OP-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}mata meguri kurikaeshiteku
Dialogue: 1,0:57:53.11,0:57:58.36,OP-Romaji,,0,0,105,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}over and over again through my head.
Dialogue: 10,0:57:53.48,0:57:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to save Mayuri!
Dialogue: 10,0:57:57.14,0:57:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.36,0:58:03.92,OP-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}kono arasoi no owari (Dead or Alive)
Dialogue: 1,0:57:58.36,0:58:03.92,OP-Romaji,,0,0,105,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}When this battle finally ends,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.92,0:58:09.00,OP-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}nokoru no wa zetsubou dake?
Dialogue: 1,0:58:03.92,0:58:09.00,OP-Romaji,,0,0,105,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}will despair be all that is left?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.36,0:58:14.19,OP-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}dare ni mo iyasenai omoi
Dialogue: 1,0:58:09.36,0:58:14.19,OP-Romaji,,0,0,105,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}The thought screams in my mind, unsilenceable.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.73,0:58:18.59,OP-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}fureta sono te de tomete
Dialogue: 1,0:58:14.73,0:58:18.59,OP-Romaji,,0,0,105,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}Please touch me and make it stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.59,0:58:24.36,OP-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}dare mo ga minna kobamu sekai de nani mo kizutsukezu koko ni
Dialogue: 1,0:58:18.59,0:58:24.36,OP-Romaji,,0,0,105,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}In this world where I am unwelcome, I can find no way to live
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.36,0:58:29.40,OP-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}irareru sube ga mitsukaranakute
Dialogue: 1,0:58:24.36,0:58:29.40,OP-Romaji,,0,0,105,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}without causing harm to those around me.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.40,0:58:38.20,OP-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}yariba mo naku kieru kanjou kimi nara uketometekureru no?
Dialogue: 1,0:58:29.40,0:58:38.20,OP-Romaji,,0,0,105,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}Will you accept these emotions that would otherwise disappear?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.20,0:58:42.06,OP-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}oshiete Date A Live
Dialogue: 1,0:58:38.20,0:58:42.06,OP-Romaji,,0,0,105,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}Tell me now—Date A Live.
Dialogue: 10,0:58:41.83,0:58:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido...
Dialogue: 10,0:58:44.62,0:58:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Give 'em hell!
Dialogue: 10,0:59:03.20,0:59:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here now.
Dialogue: 10,0:59:04.69,0:59:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido...
Dialogue: 10,0:59:05.90,0:59:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 10,0:59:07.56,0:59:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 10,0:59:08.81,0:59:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:59:10.06,0:59:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido...
Dialogue: 10,0:59:26.10,0:59:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Mayuri!
Dialogue: 10,0:59:31.25,0:59:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right, Shido?
Dialogue: 10,0:59:32.96,0:59:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and so is Mayuri!
Dialogue: 10,0:59:35.24,0:59:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let's get rid of that thing!
Dialogue: 10,0:59:55.20,0:59:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 10,0:59:57.30,0:59:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Cherubiel...
Dialogue: 10,0:59:59.14,1:00:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that...
Dialogue: 10,1:00:00.95,1:00:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Rahathelev!
Dialogue: 10,1:00:11.32,1:00:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's way stronger than it was before!
Dialogue: 10,1:00:17.52,1:00:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Reine!
Dialogue: 10,1:00:18.36,1:00:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We have the results.
Dialogue: 10,1:00:20.16,1:00:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Normal attacks won't do anything to that Angel.
Dialogue: 10,1:00:24.14,1:00:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 10,1:00:25.60,1:00:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can collect all of your\N Spirit energy into a single point,
Dialogue: 10,1:00:28.39,1:00:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,you may be able to get through.{not sure if the part after the keyframe belongs to this line of dialogue, or is it missing}{TL: part after keyframe is "...perhaps" so it's fine as it is}
Dialogue: 10,1:00:32.14,1:00:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But how would we...
Dialogue: 10,1:00:35.70,1:00:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 10,1:00:50.87,1:00:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Awe: What is this?
Dialogue: 10,1:00:57.54,1:01:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Your energies are coming together!
Dialogue: 10,1:01:02.07,1:01:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I can feel the power!
Dialogue: 10,1:01:05.42,1:01:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We can do this!
Dialogue: 10,1:01:07.08,1:01:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Nii-sama, the Angel!
Dialogue: 10,1:01:09.99,1:01:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Cherubiel!
Dialogue: 10,1:01:14.76,1:01:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We're defenseless!
Dialogue: 10,1:01:16.22,1:01:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Panic: We can't fight back!
Dialogue: 10,1:01:31.62,1:01:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Mana!
Dialogue: 10,1:01:35.87,1:01:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it for me, Nii-sama!
Dialogue: 10,1:01:43.37,1:01:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't come here yet!
Dialogue: 10,1:01:48.10,1:01:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 10,1:01:49.49,1:01:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido!
Dialogue: 10,1:01:51.07,1:01:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 10,1:01:52.39,1:01:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido!
Dialogue: 10,1:01:55.02,1:01:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll protect you.
Dialogue: 10,1:01:56.04,1:01:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I will protect...
Dialogue: 10,1:01:57.26,1:01:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,all of you... and Mayuri!
Dialogue: 10,1:01:59.94,1:02:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido!
Dialogue: 10,1:02:01.15,1:02:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido-san!
Dialogue: 10,1:02:01.55,1:02:02.65,Alternative,,0,0,0,,Darling!
Dialogue: 10,1:02:02.65,1:02:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido!
Dialogue: 10,1:02:03.61,1:02:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido!
Dialogue: 10,1:02:13.18,1:02:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido!
Dialogue: 10,1:02:41.98,1:02:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What the...
Dialogue: 10,1:02:43.08,1:02:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido!
Dialogue: 10,1:02:43.98,1:02:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Tohka?!
Dialogue: 10,1:02:45.74,1:02:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave the rest to me, Shido!
Dialogue: 10,1:02:48.19,1:02:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 10,1:03:23.14,1:03:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We can do it!
Dialogue: 10,1:03:24.24,1:03:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not enough!
Dialogue: 10,1:03:25.61,1:03:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 10,1:03:26.84,1:03:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,In order to stop Cherubiel,
Dialogue: 10,1:03:28.88,1:03:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,you need to physically destroy it
Dialogue: 10,1:03:30.96,1:03:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,and stop its supply of Spirit energy at the {\i1}same time{\i0}!
Dialogue: 10,1:03:35.28,1:03:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what do we...
Dialogue: 10,1:03:43.87,1:03:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Sandalphon!
Dialogue: 10,1:03:47.83,1:03:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Shekhinah!{archangel, counterpart of sandalphon}{After repeatedly thrusting at the girls for several minutes, Tohka pushes him over the edge, and Rahathelev's big hard shaft explodes into a cloud of white covering everything.}{kek}
Dialogue: 10,1:04:20.16,1:04:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri!
Dialogue: 10,1:04:21.66,1:04:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you...
Dialogue: 10,1:04:24.66,1:04:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm made of Spirit energy.
Dialogue: 10,1:04:27.50,1:04:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Sealing me only makes me vanish.
Dialogue: 10,1:04:31.57,1:04:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 10,1:04:32.38,1:04:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Sealing...
Dialogue: 10,1:04:33.68,1:04:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But we haven't even...
Dialogue: 10,1:04:36.10,1:04:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't seal someone you just met?
Dialogue: 10,1:04:43.18,1:04:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 10,1:04:44.94,1:04:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm made up from the energy of all the other girls.
Dialogue: 10,1:04:48.66,1:04:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,How could I ever hate you?
Dialogue: 10,1:04:53.40,1:04:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Since the moment I was born,
Dialogue: 10,1:04:57.15,1:04:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I've loved you.
Dialogue: 10,1:04:59.45,1:05:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri...
Dialogue: 10,1:05:01.27,1:05:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I tried not to think about it,
Dialogue: 10,1:05:03.43,1:05:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,but I guess I was jealous of everyone.
Dialogue: 10,1:05:08.76,1:05:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Mayuri!
Dialogue: 10,1:05:10.30,1:05:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go!
Dialogue: 10,1:05:12.69,1:05:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,But hey, at least I'm one-up on all the others,{lit: But you know what? There is one thing I can boast to the others about}
Dialogue: 10,1:05:18.04,1:05:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,because I'm the only one who can be one with you.{lit: only I was the same as Shido}{super lit: only me with shido were same}{Could probably be taken as "I was the only one who had it in common with Shido", but "in common with Shido" doesn't read well for 1:12:04}{TL: Still have no clue wtf she means by this. Maybe because Shido used to think he was worthless too? idr}
Dialogue: 10,1:05:21.97,1:05:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Be one with me?
Dialogue: 10,1:05:23.64,1:05:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I know I wasn't born to disappear...
Dialogue: 10,1:05:29.89,1:05:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,because I got to meet you.
Dialogue: 10,1:05:34.71,1:05:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all it took...
Dialogue: 10,1:05:36.84,1:05:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri!
Dialogue: 10,1:05:38.22,1:05:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you...
Dialogue: 10,1:05:41.09,1:05:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido.
Dialogue: 10,1:05:54.36,1:05:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri!
Dialogue: 10,1:06:08.35,1:06:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido-san...
Dialogue: 10,1:06:11.43,1:06:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,that makes another favor you owe me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.11,1:06:22.53,Sign #1,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75\blu0.6\fad(947,929)\bord2.25\3c&H000000&\c&H000000&\pos(960,442.5)\1a&HFF&\t(0,947,\1a&H00&)\t(2491,3420,\1a&HFF&)}Several Days Later
Dialogue: 1,1:06:19.11,1:06:22.53,Sign #1,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75\blu0.6\fad(947,929)\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(960,442.5)}Several Days Later
Dialogue: 10,1:06:25.57,1:06:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you feeling a little better?
Dialogue: 10,1:06:28.11,1:06:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,1:06:28.89,1:06:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry for worrying you.
Dialogue: 10,1:06:32.34,1:06:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri was made of Spirit energy.
Dialogue: 10,1:06:34.88,1:06:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So inside me, you, Kotori, Yoshino, Kaguya, Yuzuru, and Miku—
Dialogue: 10,1:06:41.43,1:06:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,inside all of us, she still exists.
Dialogue: 10,1:06:45.22,1:06:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure she does.
Dialogue: 10,1:06:47.36,1:06:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Inside me, too...
Dialogue: 10,1:06:50.30,1:06:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps...
Dialogue: 10,1:06:51.78,1:06:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No, she definitely is!
Dialogue: 10,1:06:55.87,1:06:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, there you guys are!
Dialogue: 10,1:06:58.86,1:07:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I figured you'd be here.
Dialogue: 10,1:07:00.84,1:07:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Kotori?
Dialogue: 10,1:07:01.69,1:07:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody?!
Dialogue: 10,1:07:02.62,1:07:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We met and decided to hold the second everybody-goes-on-a-date-with-Darling contest!
Dialogue: 10,1:07:10.16,1:07:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 10,1:07:11.13,1:07:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So I can go on a date with Shido again?
Dialogue: 10,1:07:14.48,1:07:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hold on!
Dialogue: 10,1:07:16.27,1:07:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you give it a little more time since the last one?!
Dialogue: 10,1:07:18.88,1:07:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What about next month?
Dialogue: 10,1:07:20.63,1:07:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Rejection: We must strike while the iron is hot.
Dialogue: 10,1:07:23.08,1:07:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us begin today.
Dialogue: 10,1:07:25.89,1:07:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's play again, Shido-san.
Dialogue: 10,1:07:28.89,1:07:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,1:07:30.80,1:07:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,J-Just...
Dialogue: 10,1:07:33.65,1:07:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,not today!
Dialogue: 10,1:07:37.84,1:07:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He ran away!
Dialogue: 10,1:07:38.72,1:07:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, after him!
Dialogue: 10,1:07:40.16,1:07:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold it, Shido!
Dialogue: 10,1:07:41.79,1:07:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna get you!
